<unit id="e824507c-195b-4392-b427-705f036374d5">
<notes>
<note appliesTo="source">line: 8</note>
<note appliesTo="source">prefix: ## </note>
</notes>
<segment>
<source>Introduction</source>
</segment>
</unit>
<unit id="bc90b346-293a-431e-881e-ab7f64976147">
<notes>
<note appliesTo="source">line: 10</note>
</notes>
<segment>
<source>The **FavoriteLinks** add-on is a tool to manage your favorite links in an organized and efficient way. It allows you to save, edit, and remove links in a categorized list, offering an intuitive interface with features such as adding new links, renaming titles, removing unwanted entries, and managing categories. In addition, the add-on allows importing bookmarks directly from HTML files exported by browsers.</source>
</segment>
</unit>
<unit id="76214252-524c-4fe9-8ba3-623e33a85616">
<notes>
<note appliesTo="source">line: 12</note>
</notes>
<segment>
<source>When opening the add-on, you get quick access to your links and can open them directly in the default browser. There is now also support for opening links in a secondary browser, in case you need more flexibility.</source>
</segment>
</unit>
<unit id="cee50499-abc8-492f-8c58-35213d987e2f">
<notes>
<note appliesTo="source">line: 14</note>
<note appliesTo="source">prefix: ## </note>
</notes>
<segment>
<source>Installation</source>
</segment>
</unit>
<unit id="396ae432-aa8b-4d60-bee3-7d0a39a18457">
<notes>
<note appliesTo="source">line: 16</note>
</notes>
<segment>
<source>Follow the steps below to install the **FavoriteLinks** add-on in NVDA:</source>
</segment>
</unit>
<unit id="b4edf036-9361-4693-a3c3-541176928f9b">
<notes>
<note appliesTo="source">line: 18</note>
<note appliesTo="source">prefix: 1. </note>
</notes>
<segment>
<source>In NVDA, open the **Tools** menu and select **Add-ons Store**.</source>
</segment>
</unit>
<unit id="684348f0-aa99-46a6-8930-c5e2ff6a04c0">
<notes>
<note appliesTo="source">line: 19</note>
<note appliesTo="source">prefix: 2. </note>
</notes>
<segment>
<source>In the **Available Add-ons** tab, navigate to the **Search** field.</source>
</segment>
</unit>
<unit id="e0cd427c-071f-464f-8caf-b180b2ecc193">
<notes>
<note appliesTo="source">line: 20</note>
<note appliesTo="source">prefix: 3. </note>
</notes>
<segment>
<source>Search for "favoriteLinks". In the results, press **Enter** or **Apply**, and then choose **Install**.</source>
</segment>
</unit>
<unit id="7eb8b72d-ae10-4939-b3a9-45b11b46d177">
<notes>
<note appliesTo="source">line: 21</note>
<note appliesTo="source">prefix: 4. </note>
</notes>
<segment>
<source>Restart NVDA to apply the changes.</source>
</segment>
</unit>
<unit id="380dfe41-3910-4bee-b6cb-1947997c6fe5">
<notes>
<note appliesTo="source">line: 23</note>
<note appliesTo="source">prefix: ## </note>
</notes>
<segment>
<source>Configuration</source>
</segment>
</unit>
<unit id="185f8e14-c7f0-4454-ac39-752de07f257e">
<notes>
<note appliesTo="source">line: 25</note>
</notes>
<segment>
<source>You have full control over where your links are saved and which browser opens them.</source>
</segment>
</unit>
<unit id="767b0751-90ec-4324-ba07-d5f0fa300b4e">
<notes>
<note appliesTo="source">line: 27</note>
<note appliesTo="source">prefix: 1. </note>
</notes>
<segment>
<source>Access the NVDA menu: `NVDA+N` &gt; *Preferences* &gt; *Settings*.</source>
</segment>
</unit>
<unit id="5c7f1eff-1c34-4f07-b4a3-8ac163193c68">
<notes>
<note appliesTo="source">line: 28</note>
<note appliesTo="source">prefix: 2. </note>
</notes>
<segment>
<source>In the list of categories, select **Favorite Links**.</source>
</segment>
</unit>
<unit id="142fb37d-bd53-4b64-a421-89a000363ae5">
<notes>
<note appliesTo="source">line: 30</note>
</notes>
<segment>
<source>You can choose a custom location to save the links file using the **"Select or add a directory"** button (`Alt+S`).</source>
</segment>
</unit>
<unit id="67a8a957-f60a-45f1-b2d7-e1b69a2537be">
<notes>
<note appliesTo="source">line: 32</note>
</notes>
<segment>
<source>To define a secondary browser, which can be either installed or portable:</source>
</segment>
</unit>
<unit id="18cfdc61-b9f9-422a-b1be-fd29b7c144eb">
<notes>
<note appliesTo="source">line: 34</note>
<note appliesTo="source">prefix: 1. </note>
</notes>
<segment>
<source>Navigate with `Tab` to the **Browser path** field.</source>
</segment>
</unit>
<unit id="89e1715d-aaad-48f8-a076-7b04bb554bcf">
<notes>
<note appliesTo="source">line: 35</note>
<note appliesTo="source">prefix: 2. </note>
</notes>
<segment>
<source>Use the **"Select browser path"** button (`Alt+N`) to add the executable of the desired browser.</source>
</segment>
</unit>
<unit id="5ffbe774-81e8-4148-b201-d54d6437b1b3">
<notes>
<note appliesTo="source">line: 37</note>
<note appliesTo="source">prefix: ## </note>
</notes>
<segment>
<source>Usage</source>
</segment>
</unit>
<unit id="46830f98-2ed0-494e-9edf-cff252417a1e">
<notes>
<note appliesTo="source">line: 39</note>
<note appliesTo="source">prefix: ### </note>
</notes>
<segment>
<source>Accessing the Add-on</source>
</segment>
</unit>
<unit id="398bf5e9-81e8-4f0d-94ba-84229c96afe4">
<notes>
<note appliesTo="source">line: 41</note>
<note appliesTo="source">prefix: * </note>
</notes>
<segment>
<source>Press `Alt+Windows+K`.</source>
</segment>
</unit>
<unit id="813339b5-3d9d-488c-aa48-c024a4225102">
<notes>
<note appliesTo="source">line: 42</note>
<note appliesTo="source">prefix: * </note>
</notes>
<segment>
<source>Or access via `NVDA+N` &gt; *Tools* &gt; *Favorite Links*.</source>
</segment>
</unit>
<unit id="cb7e1b50-fedd-4b45-bc46-5692a7f48fff">
<notes>
<note appliesTo="source">line: 44</note>
<note appliesTo="source">prefix: ### </note>
</notes>
<segment>
<source>Main Interface</source>
</segment>
</unit>
<unit id="f2667403-8ff3-4d58-a44f-05f957ba6ee5">
<notes>
<note appliesTo="source">line: 46</note>
</notes>
<segment>
<source>The main interface consists of two main fields, which can be navigated using the `Tab` key:</source>
</segment>
</unit>
<unit id="494857a0-2a97-42cf-a15d-65884d56622c">
<notes>
<note appliesTo="source">line: 48</note>
<note appliesTo="source">prefix: 1. </note>
</notes>
<segment>
<source>**Category**: A combo box with the existing categories.</source>
</segment>
</unit>
<unit id="ff30ac8c-4900-4560-a0e3-cdff407c765a">
<notes>
<note appliesTo="source">line: 49</note>
<note appliesTo="source">prefix: 2. </note>
</notes>
<segment>
<source>**Links List**: A list that shows the links associated with the selected category.</source>
</segment>
</unit>
<unit id="c9414b13-8378-4391-ba72-4a29268b819c">
<notes>
<note appliesTo="source">line: 51</note>
</notes>
<segment>
<source>Use the **context menu** (applications key) in any of these fields to access additional options.</source>
</segment>
</unit>
<unit id="f15ef5df-9114-4590-8546-4ed4f9348333">
<notes>
<note appliesTo="source">line: 53</note>
<note appliesTo="source">prefix: ### </note>
</notes>
<segment>
<source>Available Actions</source>
</segment>
</unit>
<unit id="f3b2dc6d-c36e-4916-ae9a-3656e04f39b4">
<notes>
<note appliesTo="source">line: 55</note>
<note appliesTo="source">prefix: #### </note>
</notes>
<segment>
<source>In the Categories Combo Box</source>
</segment>
</unit>
<unit id="d7531005-da7f-4301-8d25-e6bc31c44a2e">
<notes>
<note appliesTo="source">line: 57</note>
<note appliesTo="source">prefix: * </note>
</notes>
<segment>
<source>**Add Category**: Creates a new category.</source>
</segment>
</unit>
<unit id="27b507cd-8659-4857-9849-c577136d6c25">
<notes>
<note appliesTo="source">line: 58</note>
<note appliesTo="source">prefix: * </note>
</notes>
<segment>
<source>**Edit Category**: Renames the selected category.</source>
</segment>
</unit>
<unit id="394532ae-3941-450d-9d39-15e0e6f738c7">
<notes>
<note appliesTo="source">line: 59</note>
<note appliesTo="source">prefix: * </note>
</notes>
<segment>
<source>**Remove Category**: Deletes the category and all its links.</source>
</segment>
</unit>
<unit id="5872864e-414d-4f9a-b303-b9e67edafc5e">
<notes>
<note appliesTo="source">line: 60</note>
<note appliesTo="source">prefix: * </note>
</notes>
<segment>
<source>**Export Links**: Saves all links and categories to a `.json` file.</source>
</segment>
</unit>
<unit id="21e19bf7-a557-417c-9b00-57b803127e02">
<notes>
<note appliesTo="source">line: 61</note>
<note appliesTo="source">prefix: * </note>
</notes>
<segment>
<source>**Import Links**: Loads links and categories from a `.json` file.</source>
</segment>
</unit>
<unit id="4f9de093-d0cd-4093-a957-ea78c25044d5">
<notes>
<note appliesTo="source">line: 63</note>
<note appliesTo="source">prefix: #### </note>
</notes>
<segment>
<source>In the Links List</source>
</segment>
</unit>
<unit id="4b013849-ea1b-4121-ad08-bd1b3ca59874">
<notes>
<note appliesTo="source">line: 65</note>
<note appliesTo="source">prefix: * </note>
</notes>
<segment>
<source>**Open Link**: Opens the link in the browser you configured.</source>
</segment>
</unit>
<unit id="d56b1e48-cf89-4429-9bba-537d4f1ad704">
<notes>
<note appliesTo="source">line: 66</note>
</notes>
<segment>
<source>    &gt; **Note**: It is necessary to configure the secondary browser beforehand in the settings.</source>
</segment>
</unit>
<unit id="c134fe16-75ac-4b99-bd6a-20c79a7b4fc3">
<notes>
<note appliesTo="source">line: 67</note>
<note appliesTo="source">prefix: * </note>
</notes>
<segment>
<source>**Add Link**: Allows inserting a new URL. The title will be obtained automatically, but you can enter it manually if the retrieval fails.</source>
</segment>
</unit>
<unit id="b915a505-6971-48bb-9db7-0a31c7fae464">
<notes>
<note appliesTo="source">line: 68</note>
<note appliesTo="source">prefix: * </note>
</notes>
<segment>
<source>**Edit Link**: Modifies the title and URL of an existing link.</source>
</segment>
</unit>
<unit id="029f8799-fbf6-4530-b2db-27aedaf3ee1f">
<notes>
<note appliesTo="source">line: 69</note>
<note appliesTo="source">prefix: * </note>
</notes>
<segment>
<source>**Remove Link**: Deletes the selected link.</source>
</segment>
</unit>
<unit id="6b9a1711-940c-4288-8c14-862206d1e3fc">
<notes>
<note appliesTo="source">line: 70</note>
<note appliesTo="source">prefix: * </note>
</notes>
<segment>
<source>**Export Links** / **Import Links**: Same as the category options.</source>
</segment>
</unit>
<unit id="deb1190c-d5fc-41b6-9085-e232600ecd3f">
<notes>
<note appliesTo="source">line: 71</note>
<note appliesTo="source">prefix: * </note>
</notes>
<segment>
<source>**Import HTML Bookmarks**: Imports links from a `.html` file exported by browsers.</source>
</segment>
</unit>
<unit id="dfd0eb7e-6064-42ad-8f33-350301e6c712">
<notes>
<note appliesTo="source">line: 72</note>
<note appliesTo="source">prefix: * </note>
</notes>
<segment>
<source>**Sort Links**: Organizes the links of the current category in alphabetical order.</source>
</segment>
</unit>
<unit id="8d28b570-61eb-4d44-bf8d-47094508cbf4">
<notes>
<note appliesTo="source">line: 74</note>
